{"words": [{"text": "وَٱذْكُرُوٓا۟", "translation": "And remember"}, {"text": "إِذْ", "translation": "when"}, {"text": "جَعَلَكُمْ", "translation": "He made you"}, {"text": "خُلَفَآءَ", "translation": "successors"}, {"text": "مِنۢ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "بَعْدِ", "translation": "after"}, {"text": "عَادٍۢ", "translation": "Aad"}, {"text": "وَبَوَّأَكُمْ", "translation": "and settled you"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "ٱلْأَرْضِ", "translation": "the earth"}, {"text": "تَتَّخِذُونَ", "translation": "You take"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "سُهُولِهَا", "translation": "its plains"}, {"text": "قُصُورًۭا", "translation": "palaces"}, {"text": "وَتَنْحِتُونَ", "translation": "and you carve out"}, {"text": "ٱلْجِبَالَ", "translation": "the mountains"}, {"text": "بُيُوتًۭا ۖ", "translation": "(as) homes"}, {"text": "فَٱذْكُرُوٓا۟", "translation": "So remember"}, {"text": "ءَالَآءَ", "translation": "(the) Bounties"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "(of) Allah"}, {"text": "وَلَا", "translation": "and (do) not"}, {"text": "تَعْثَوْا۟", "translation": "act wickedly"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "ٱلْأَرْضِ", "translation": "(the) earth"}, {"text": "مُفْسِدِينَ", "translation": "spreading corruption"}], "sahih": "And remember when He made you successors after the ʿAad and settled you in the land, [and] you take for yourselves palaces from its plains and carve from the mountains, homes. Then remember the favors of Allāh and do not commit abuse on the earth, spreading corruption.\""}